WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.306
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.406 --> 00:01.446
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.446 --> 00:02.516
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.516 --> 00:03.576
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:05.346 --> 00:07.416
(Episode 26)

6
00:08.986 --> 00:10.256
Such a sweet scent.

7
00:10.856 --> 00:11.926
I feel alive again.

8
00:37.616 --> 00:40.916
Because of you, I could not sleep or even shower.

9
00:41.556 --> 00:43.556
Do you know how many days I staked out in my car?

10
00:44.356 --> 00:45.356
Get lost.

11
00:45.786 --> 00:47.786
I do not even want to see your face, so get lost.

12
00:51.896 --> 00:53.496
Do you want to get hit, or will you come quietly?

13
00:55.096 --> 00:56.436
Help me.

14
01:01.836 --> 01:05.376
Hey. Let go of me. Help me.

15
01:07.876 --> 01:09.076
Let go.

16
01:10.346 --> 01:11.346
Get in.

17
01:13.816 --> 01:15.386
Mister, please help me.

18
01:16.956 --> 01:18.686
She is my wife. She ran away after cheating on me.

19
01:19.256 --> 01:22.156
Honey, please come to your senses.

20
01:22.596 --> 01:24.996
Our newborn baby is crying, looking for you right now.

21
01:25.496 --> 01:26.726
He is lying.

22
01:27.126 --> 01:28.896
A mother should think about her baby.

23
01:29.336 --> 01:31.336
Please come to your senses, honey.

24
01:33.606 --> 01:34.606
Get in right now.

25
01:35.536 --> 01:36.806
Let us go home.

26
01:38.646 --> 01:39.646
Gyu Young?

27
01:40.106 --> 01:42.416
- Han Gyu Seo. - Gyu Young.

28
01:44.276 --> 01:45.486
Who are you?

29
01:46.716 --> 01:47.746
- What the heck? - Gyu Young.

30
01:47.816 --> 01:48.816
Gyu Young.

31
01:48.886 --> 01:50.016
- Gyu Young. - Gyu Young.

32
01:53.156 --> 01:54.256
Han Gyu Young.

33
01:55.696 --> 01:56.696
Where are you going?

34
01:57.196 --> 01:59.096
Let go, you bastard.

35
02:00.296 --> 02:02.096
Who do you think you are, you bastard?

36
02:03.696 --> 02:05.336
Do I look like a pushover to you?

37
02:06.236 --> 02:09.606
This looks expensive. Did someone drop this?

38
02:12.406 --> 02:17.376
Gyu Young. What is wrong with you? Hey, Gyu Young.

39
02:17.646 --> 02:20.416
Hey, it is me. Heung Sik.

40
02:35.136 --> 02:37.596
Heung Sik.

41
02:42.536 --> 02:45.646
Yes, yes. What happened?

42
02:55.186 --> 02:57.556
Gyu Seo.

43
02:57.916 --> 02:59.656
- Hey. - It hurts.

44
02:59.726 --> 03:02.996
Hey. What are you doing here?

45
03:03.696 --> 03:08.266
And why do you look like this? Did that psycho Sung Wook do this?

46
03:08.636 --> 03:10.966
I was on my way to deliver opening-day rice cakes for Gyu Oh.

47
03:12.106 --> 03:13.666
Who is that jerk?

48
03:14.006 --> 03:16.136
Why was he trying to kidnap Gyu Young?

49
03:16.206 --> 03:18.376
And why on earth is she here?

50
03:18.706 --> 03:20.476
He claims to be her husband,

51
03:21.046 --> 03:25.016
but it is a long story. Let us call an ambulance first.

52
03:27.646 --> 03:28.816
Darn it.

53
03:31.586 --> 03:33.956
A girl whose mind is not even sound, you know?

54
03:34.026 --> 03:36.696
How could you wander off without fear?

55
03:37.856 --> 03:39.666
I was watching television,

56
03:39.726 --> 03:41.966
and you could not even wait while I shut my eyes...

57
03:42.036 --> 03:45.006
before sneaking off like a fart through baggy pants?

58
03:47.636 --> 03:51.476
Oh my. No, it's fine.

59
03:51.846 --> 03:54.406
I am not scolding you.

60
03:54.806 --> 03:58.416
Seeing you look like this...

61
03:58.516 --> 04:02.016
just breaks my heart, you know? It makes me so upset.

62
04:02.856 --> 04:05.156
Whoever did this better not get caught by me.

63
04:05.326 --> 04:08.026
I will rip his intestines out right from his belly...

64
04:08.086 --> 04:10.126
and jump rope with them, I swear.

65
04:11.526 --> 04:12.866
Grandma.

66
04:13.226 --> 04:16.536
Yes, yes. Right.

67
04:16.736 --> 04:18.306
I know.

68
04:18.806 --> 04:21.236
Still, it is such a relief it was not worse.

69
04:21.906 --> 04:24.836
Heung Sik called earlier and said...

70
04:25.406 --> 04:27.476
someone stepped in to help you, right?

71
04:28.346 --> 04:32.146
People say this world is harsh and cold,

72
04:32.646 --> 04:35.086
but good people still exist.

73
04:37.056 --> 04:39.956
That is what makes life worth living, right?

74
04:41.626 --> 04:42.896
Why don't we...

75
04:43.256 --> 04:46.166
dip some rice cakes in honey and have a tasty bite?

76
04:46.566 --> 04:49.596
What do you say? Come on, let us go.

77
04:51.936 --> 04:53.666
Could you bring them here for me, Grandma?

78
04:54.066 --> 04:55.776
What? Should I?

79
04:56.336 --> 04:58.646
You do not want to go out? All right, then.

80
05:07.316 --> 05:09.916
(Emergency Ward)

81
05:11.056 --> 05:12.886
You knucklehead.

82
05:15.226 --> 05:17.326
Still, it is a miracle it was not worse.

83
05:17.526 --> 05:19.166
They said your organs are fine,

84
05:19.596 --> 05:22.536
- and no bones are broken. - So...

85
05:23.666 --> 05:26.036
So Gyu Young was tricked into marriage?

86
05:30.306 --> 05:32.446
Well, she swapped out her father...

87
05:32.906 --> 05:35.176
and pretended to be an heiress herself,

88
05:35.276 --> 05:36.746
so she is just as guilty as them.

89
05:36.876 --> 05:39.146
That is why she cannot even report it to the police.

90
05:41.016 --> 05:43.386
Though compared to the scumbags in her husband's family,

91
05:43.616 --> 05:45.786
her scam was practically nothing.

92
05:47.356 --> 05:49.356
When is she ever going to grow up?

93
05:50.256 --> 05:52.126
When the world freezes over?

94
05:52.696 --> 05:54.766
Just tell yourself it serves her right, okay?

95
05:54.896 --> 05:58.936
Think about how much she picked on you twins.

96
05:59.406 --> 06:02.506
Just look at it as karma for treating you so terribly.

97
06:02.936 --> 06:06.976
That way, you will stress less, and you will heal faster.

98
06:07.376 --> 06:09.576
Yes, I will try.

99
06:10.346 --> 06:13.516
Good for her. She had it coming. Talk about a rush.

100
06:14.416 --> 06:15.786
I will try to think like that.

101
06:16.656 --> 06:19.856
Easier said than done, right?

102
06:20.486 --> 06:22.326
The moment you heard your sister was in danger,

103
06:22.556 --> 06:23.796
you charged right in,

104
06:23.856 --> 06:25.826
not even caring if it got you killed...

105
06:29.066 --> 06:31.196
Blood really runs deep.

106
06:31.596 --> 06:32.766
That is not true.

107
06:33.066 --> 06:34.706
We basically disowned each other anyway.

108
06:34.806 --> 06:35.976
Sure, sure.

109
06:36.036 --> 06:38.306
Hey, but it turns out you are not completely fine.

110
06:38.746 --> 06:41.746
They think your right eardrum might be ruptured.

111
06:42.746 --> 06:45.216
They told you to see an ENT first thing tomorrow...

112
06:45.286 --> 06:48.556
and get a thorough checkup. Let us go together tomorrow.

113
06:50.956 --> 06:52.256
Am I a child?

114
06:53.286 --> 06:56.556
I can go to the clinic on my own, so do not worry about it.

115
06:59.296 --> 07:00.796
I feel fine now.

116
07:01.296 --> 07:03.536
Do I have to finish this IV before I can go home?

117
07:08.576 --> 07:10.576
Did you say Han Gyu Young?

118
07:10.876 --> 07:12.776
Yes. She is...

119
07:13.506 --> 07:18.386
- Gyu Rim's younger sister. - My goodness.

120
07:18.816 --> 07:23.416
How did someone so sharp end up completely out of her mind...

121
07:23.486 --> 07:25.056
and staying at your house?

122
07:46.006 --> 07:48.746
And what suddenly happened to her forehead?

123
07:49.416 --> 07:53.416
My Heung Sik just flicked her right there.

124
07:54.116 --> 07:55.416
That little...

125
07:56.316 --> 07:57.786
Well, Gyu Young was acting so darn annoying...

126
07:57.856 --> 07:59.556
and getting under his skin,

127
07:59.626 --> 08:02.026
so he just flicked her forehead as a joke,

128
08:02.696 --> 08:05.566
and she just passed right out, you know?

129
08:05.926 --> 08:10.836
Then she woke up a little later, and she turned into a complete fool.

130
08:10.896 --> 08:13.366
She even completely lost her memory.

131
08:13.636 --> 08:16.706
That makes no sense. Just from one flick to the forehead,

132
08:16.776 --> 08:19.006
how could someone get amnesia and turn into an idiot?

133
08:19.146 --> 08:20.746
What, are your son's hands...

134
08:20.806 --> 08:24.446
- made of solid steel or something? - They might as well be, honestly.

135
08:24.916 --> 08:26.986
In the past, he knocked six teeth out in a single blow.

136
08:27.046 --> 08:30.886
His fists are lethal, I tell you.

137
08:31.516 --> 08:32.926
I had to pay damages for that...

138
08:32.986 --> 08:35.356
and ended up losing an entire commercial property.

139
08:36.396 --> 08:37.556
Anyway, back to the point.

140
08:39.066 --> 08:43.266
Heung Sik is the one who made Gyu Young end up like that,

141
08:43.736 --> 08:45.966
so we couldn't tell her family...

142
08:46.036 --> 08:48.476
and have been hiding her at our place.

143
08:49.806 --> 08:52.406
It's so lucky that you're a lawyer.

144
08:54.946 --> 08:56.176
Hey, hometown boy,

145
08:57.976 --> 09:00.746
could you please help me out?

146
09:01.956 --> 09:04.886
I'll accept whatever punishment I deserve,

147
09:05.486 --> 09:08.796
so please just help Gyu Young get her memory back, okay?

148
09:09.526 --> 09:12.866
Well, it's not like I'm a doctor...

149
09:12.996 --> 09:14.596
Since you're a big-shot lawyer,

150
09:14.666 --> 09:16.736
you must know a doctor or two, right?

151
09:16.796 --> 09:18.736
You're both professionals, aren't you?

152
09:22.206 --> 09:26.276
- I think I can help you. - What? How?

153
09:27.106 --> 09:29.116
I'm a psychiatrist.

154
09:29.216 --> 09:30.976
And amnesia happens to be my specialty.

155
09:32.786 --> 09:34.516
Is that really true?

156
09:35.556 --> 09:38.256
You've come to the right place. I'll take care of it for you.

157
09:38.756 --> 09:41.756
First, would it be possible for me to see the patient?

158
09:41.756 --> 09:42.996
Yes, of course.

159
09:43.056 --> 09:46.796
When would be a good time?

160
09:52.506 --> 09:54.566
One, two,

161
09:55.976 --> 09:57.236
one.

162
10:05.946 --> 10:08.386
Secretary Jeong, did you look into it?

163
10:09.616 --> 10:12.286
No, just some basic self-defence moves, you know.

164
10:12.286 --> 10:13.326
Like...

165
10:13.926 --> 10:15.156
What do you mean, out of nowhere?

166
10:15.226 --> 10:16.326
It's good exercise too, so I figured...

167
10:16.396 --> 10:17.396
Dad!

168
10:18.626 --> 10:20.196
Yes, I will call you back.

169
10:25.366 --> 10:27.206
Are you planning to get into real fights now?

170
10:27.636 --> 10:29.476
What, are you going to beat everyone up with your fists?

171
10:30.076 --> 10:31.236
Seriously.

172
10:32.576 --> 10:35.046
Dad, why are you doing this too?

173
10:35.476 --> 10:37.846
You used to shudder at even the mention of violence.

174
10:40.986 --> 10:44.186
Those people were living just fine on their own,

175
10:44.256 --> 10:46.656
so why drag another family straight into the gutter?

176
10:47.456 --> 10:48.796
Why do you keep talking like that?

177
10:50.456 --> 10:52.296
"Those people?"

178
10:53.096 --> 10:54.926
They're practically our family too.

179
10:55.596 --> 10:57.136
If you're Go Yoon Hee's daughter,

180
10:58.666 --> 11:00.336
then Han Gyu Young is your younger sister too.

181
11:00.736 --> 11:03.506
This is completely driving me crazy.

182
11:06.076 --> 11:07.876
Are they family just because you say so?

183
11:08.206 --> 11:09.646
Does forcing people together make them family?

184
11:10.576 --> 11:14.016
That is why Han Gyu Rim and I became a trashy spectacle,

185
11:14.146 --> 11:15.286
two sisters fighting over one man.

186
11:15.356 --> 11:16.356
Seo Hyun.

187
11:19.586 --> 11:20.686
No, forget it. Let us drop it.

188
11:24.526 --> 11:25.526
Seo Hyun.

189
11:26.566 --> 11:27.566
Do you remember?

190
11:28.226 --> 11:29.966
Back when you had your appendectomy.

191
11:32.236 --> 11:33.736
While you were in the hospital,

192
11:34.506 --> 11:37.206
Gyu Rim called your mother for the first time in ten years.

193
11:37.976 --> 11:39.346
She begged her to come just once,

194
11:39.476 --> 11:40.546
saying she desperately needed her mom.

195
11:41.776 --> 11:42.846
But your mother...

196
11:43.846 --> 11:45.616
She stayed by your bedside and refused to go.

197
11:48.546 --> 11:51.016
Gyu Rim must have changed her number...

198
11:51.016 --> 11:52.226
because we lost all contact with her.

199
11:55.026 --> 11:56.026
Anyway...

200
11:56.896 --> 11:58.866
It has been weighing on my conscience ever since.

201
12:00.296 --> 12:02.496
I just feel like we owe Gyu Rim a massive debt.

202
12:05.606 --> 12:06.606
I just...

203
12:09.106 --> 12:10.276
I just wanted you to know that.

204
12:28.856 --> 12:31.026
(This message has been unsent.)

205
12:31.856 --> 12:32.866
Gyu Oh.

206
12:34.696 --> 12:37.936
What were you trying to tell me?

207
12:38.096 --> 12:40.666
(This message has been unsent.)

208
12:42.506 --> 12:44.976
What did you want to say to your mom?

209
12:46.806 --> 12:50.076
(Congratulations on the Grand Opening, Han Gyu Oh)

210
12:52.546 --> 12:53.816
Congratulations, Han Gyu Oh.

211
12:54.146 --> 12:56.686
May your store be such a hit you die counting your cash.

212
12:59.956 --> 13:01.856
I am so sorry I could not make it to the opening.

213
13:03.026 --> 13:04.496
With Gyeol...

214
13:04.596 --> 13:06.296
and your father and sisters there,

215
13:06.626 --> 13:08.836
announcing I'm your girlfriend...

216
13:08.896 --> 13:10.096
did not feel right today.

217
13:10.566 --> 13:13.506
You made the right call. It was total chaos today anyway.

218
13:13.866 --> 13:15.706
I would not have had a second to take care of you.

219
13:15.976 --> 13:16.976
What can I do for you?

220
13:17.536 --> 13:19.106
What would you like as an opening gift?

221
13:21.876 --> 13:23.746
A song and dance?

222
13:25.246 --> 13:26.386
Marry me, Gyu Oh.

223
13:28.246 --> 13:29.456
Let us get married today.

224
13:30.156 --> 13:31.716
There is a cathedral nearby,

225
13:32.826 --> 13:33.886
a church,

226
13:34.386 --> 13:36.026
and a temple a 30-minute walk away.

227
13:37.526 --> 13:39.366
Or...

228
13:47.036 --> 13:50.036
Here is a photo of my late grandparents.

229
13:50.536 --> 13:52.076
We can just make our vows in front of them.

230
13:59.986 --> 14:01.116
And here is a cup of cold water.

231
14:02.016 --> 14:03.456
Did people not use to get married back in the day...

232
14:03.516 --> 14:04.586
with just a single bowl of water?

233
14:06.156 --> 14:07.356
Where is this coming from all of a sudden?

234
14:08.486 --> 14:09.756
Do you not want to marry me?

235
14:12.396 --> 14:14.066
We have to get our parents' blessing first.

236
14:14.166 --> 14:16.296
Our families have not even met yet.

237
14:16.696 --> 14:17.936
We are not children.

238
14:18.906 --> 14:20.466
We are old enough...

239
14:20.606 --> 14:21.806
to marry without our parents' consent.

240
14:22.606 --> 14:23.976
Still, this is not right.

241
14:24.606 --> 14:27.606
I want to earn more money, and stand on equal footing with you...

242
14:28.816 --> 14:30.116
socially and financially,

243
14:31.016 --> 14:33.046
so I can hold my head high in front of you.

244
14:33.846 --> 14:35.786
My dad's business went bankrupt,

245
14:35.856 --> 14:38.056
so my parents are renting a tiny apartment in the countryside,

246
14:38.386 --> 14:39.456
and my brother...

247
14:40.226 --> 14:41.426
He got into an accident...

248
14:41.486 --> 14:42.556
uses a wheelchair, and is disabled now.

249
14:44.756 --> 14:48.126
From the shock of it all, I think Dad developed dementia.

250
14:49.266 --> 14:50.796
So we also have debts to pay off.

251
14:52.966 --> 14:55.106
That is why two-thirds of my paycheck each month...

252
14:55.206 --> 14:56.206
goes to my family.

253
14:58.906 --> 15:02.816
Just three months ago, we were known as the local elites,

254
15:03.616 --> 15:07.046
but at lightning speed, we were completely ruined.

255
15:10.356 --> 15:12.326
From now on, on my remaining one-third,

256
15:12.526 --> 15:15.926
I will have to pinch every penny, and I might nag you like crazy.

257
15:17.156 --> 15:19.866
For now, we cannot afford a nice home,

258
15:20.026 --> 15:21.166
nice clothes,

259
15:22.236 --> 15:23.536
or good food.

260
15:26.066 --> 15:28.006
Usually when a family's situation is like this,

261
15:28.436 --> 15:30.636
marriage is the last thing on anyone's mind,

262
15:31.436 --> 15:34.276
but I do not care. I have to marry you.

263
15:36.076 --> 15:38.346
A hundred times a day, I just want to collapse,

264
15:39.016 --> 15:41.016
so I need you to stay right by my side.

265
15:46.386 --> 15:49.896
I thought you were a princess, but you are sweet.

266
15:50.296 --> 15:51.596
You are not running away,

267
15:51.726 --> 15:53.226
and you say you will pay off their debts.

268
15:54.696 --> 15:57.096
If my parents pass away someday,

269
15:57.696 --> 15:58.966
I will take care of my brother too.

270
15:59.236 --> 16:00.236
Are you crazy?

271
16:00.606 --> 16:01.766
How could you take care of him?

272
16:01.766 --> 16:03.876
- A breeze could knock you over. - What?

273
16:04.276 --> 16:06.746
I should be the one to look after your brother.

274
16:06.746 --> 16:07.946
A man should help him bathe.

275
16:09.446 --> 16:10.476
Gyu Oh.

276
16:18.586 --> 16:19.726
Kwon Hee Na and Han Gyu Oh...

277
16:21.056 --> 16:22.186
are getting married today.

278
16:22.896 --> 16:23.956
Please be our witnesses,

279
16:24.526 --> 16:25.526
Grandpa, Grandma.

280
16:26.596 --> 16:28.596
Are you really marrying me right now?

281
16:31.136 --> 16:32.166
Were you joking?

282
16:32.966 --> 16:34.906
No, I was not.

283
16:35.636 --> 16:36.636
It was not a joke.

284
16:55.556 --> 16:56.556
I promise.

285
16:58.426 --> 17:00.496
In one year, I will replace this with a real gold ring.

286
17:07.866 --> 17:09.206
Until the day I die,

287
17:09.276 --> 17:10.876
I will protect Hee Na and her family,

288
17:11.506 --> 17:12.506
respect them,

289
17:13.076 --> 17:15.276
and live loving her more than myself.

290
17:17.076 --> 17:18.516
I swear it, Grandpa, Grandma.

291
17:33.096 --> 17:36.966
(Seo Min Ju)

292
17:41.536 --> 17:43.736
The person you have called cannot be reached...

293
17:43.806 --> 17:45.006
(Kwon Hee Na)

294
18:09.196 --> 18:10.236
My legs hurt.

295
18:11.866 --> 18:14.106
The new arrivals this time are totally underwhelming.

296
18:21.006 --> 18:22.006
Order yours again.

297
18:32.056 --> 18:34.026
What is this?

298
18:42.396 --> 18:43.696
Is this the Han Gyu Oh you know?

299
18:44.496 --> 18:46.566
It is the Han Gyu Oh you have been frantically searching for, right?

300
18:47.766 --> 18:48.766
Wait...

301
18:50.836 --> 18:54.206
Why do you have a picture of Gyu Oh?

302
18:54.476 --> 18:55.646
Han Gyu Oh...

303
18:56.016 --> 18:58.146
He is Kwon Hee Na's boyfriend.

304
19:13.866 --> 19:16.466
Only when Mu Jin becomes a beggar...

305
19:17.166 --> 19:19.136
will you finally leave him.

306
19:19.706 --> 19:22.036
You will run off without looking back.

307
19:22.106 --> 19:23.736
Hey, do you think...

308
19:25.276 --> 19:29.816
I do not know about parasites like you?

309
19:34.216 --> 19:36.716
Before I completely destroy...

310
19:37.486 --> 19:40.486
my Mu Jin to the ends of the earth, please...

311
19:41.686 --> 19:42.696
Hey.

312
19:43.596 --> 19:47.926
Hey, could you please just get lost? Please.

313
19:49.766 --> 19:51.866
Are you perhaps...

314
19:52.266 --> 19:55.306
trying to become Cinderella just like your mother?

315
19:57.106 --> 19:59.346
Wake up from that dream, girl.

316
19:59.876 --> 20:00.876
Do you know who I am?

317
20:01.406 --> 20:04.916
Me? I am Hong Ok Seon. And you?

318
20:05.576 --> 20:06.586
Hey.

319
20:07.686 --> 20:09.986
You are a leech.

320
20:11.856 --> 20:13.026
A cockroach.

321
20:38.376 --> 20:40.116
Will it break just from that?

322
20:44.416 --> 20:45.986
Kim Mu Jin...

323
20:46.886 --> 20:48.156
is mine!

324
20:52.026 --> 20:53.526
Who is going to hear that?

325
20:58.936 --> 21:02.466
Kim Mu Jin belongs to Han Gyu Rim!

326
21:03.276 --> 21:05.376
I will not give him to anyone!

327
21:07.406 --> 21:10.216
This is real, right? I am not dreaming right now, am I?

328
21:14.316 --> 21:16.186
I love you, Kim Mu Jin!

329
21:17.716 --> 21:20.056
To the sky, to the earth,

330
21:20.586 --> 21:24.196
as big as the whole universe. I love you.

331
21:29.336 --> 21:31.366
With this memory, I will be happy...

332
21:31.866 --> 21:33.366
for the next thousand years. No.

333
21:34.006 --> 21:35.666
I think I will be happy for 10,000 years.

334
22:06.036 --> 22:07.436
My head.

335
22:09.436 --> 22:10.506
My head hurts.

336
22:13.676 --> 22:15.406
What? Why was I...

337
22:15.976 --> 22:17.846
Why am I sleeping here?

338
22:19.316 --> 22:20.616
My head.

339
22:22.116 --> 22:23.516
You smell like alcohol.

340
22:24.956 --> 22:26.456
My goodness,

341
22:27.426 --> 22:28.926
this was practically brand new.

342
22:30.056 --> 22:31.856
Did you drink this all by yourself?

343
22:37.296 --> 22:40.806
Yeon Joo called me. She asked what was wrong with you.

344
22:41.566 --> 22:43.676
You called her last night and threatened her.

345
22:44.506 --> 22:45.506
Threatened her?

346
22:48.006 --> 22:50.046
You said if she brags about her husband once more,

347
22:50.116 --> 22:51.646
you would tell everyone she had breast surgery...

348
22:51.716 --> 22:53.216
in the US during college.

349
22:54.246 --> 22:55.286
She said I did that?

350
22:55.746 --> 22:59.586
I mean, how much did you drink to black out like that?

351
23:01.086 --> 23:02.456
Wait a minute...

352
23:09.336 --> 23:11.536
Hey, did I really call Yeon Joo?

353
23:11.596 --> 23:13.336
For 23 minutes?

354
23:15.536 --> 23:16.636
Crazy.

355
23:17.906 --> 23:19.206
Why?

356
23:19.276 --> 23:21.076
Did you make a mess with someone else too?

357
23:22.916 --> 23:24.576
I called Han Gyu Rim.

358
23:24.916 --> 23:25.916
What?

359
23:27.386 --> 23:29.016
What did you say to her?

360
23:30.286 --> 23:31.586
I just blacked out,

361
23:31.656 --> 23:34.186
so how on earth would I remember that?

362
23:39.326 --> 23:40.796
Mom, not here.

363
24:04.286 --> 24:07.226
- Good morning. - Good morning, Gyu Rim.

364
24:08.826 --> 24:11.496
This is a short video Gyu Min showed me.

365
24:12.026 --> 24:13.226
Wait just a second.

366
24:34.746 --> 24:36.386
This is Kim Mu Jin.

367
24:36.956 --> 24:39.856
Isn't he gorgeous? Totally swoon-worthy, right?

368
24:42.286 --> 24:45.996
- What are you doing? - Still, do not fall for him, guys.

369
24:46.096 --> 24:48.896
Once you fall for Mu Jin, there is no hope.

370
24:49.496 --> 24:51.736
Because Mu Jin is a black hole with no exit.

371
24:51.796 --> 24:55.036
If you fall into that black hole, you might not survive,

372
24:55.106 --> 24:57.936
so don't even look his way.

373
24:58.406 --> 25:01.206
Besides, Mu Jin is already taken.

374
25:02.006 --> 25:03.316
He has an insanely amazing,

375
25:03.316 --> 25:06.716
all-around perfect girlfriend, you know.

376
25:08.116 --> 25:09.186
And that would be...

377
25:09.246 --> 25:10.786
me, myself, and I.

378
25:13.126 --> 25:14.226
You are killing me.

379
25:14.486 --> 25:16.596
How can you be this adorable, Han Gyu Rim?

380
25:21.396 --> 25:23.496
I wanted to make you laugh,

381
25:24.066 --> 25:25.836
so feel free to laugh at me.

382
25:26.966 --> 25:28.106
No way.

383
25:28.306 --> 25:30.736
Thanks to you, I got a huge laugh first thing this morning.

384
25:31.076 --> 25:32.136
After we hang up,

385
25:32.206 --> 25:34.276
I will probably roll around laughing.

386
25:34.546 --> 25:36.946
My dopamine is fully recharged thanks to you.

387
25:37.076 --> 25:38.116
Thank you, Gyu Rim.

388
25:39.076 --> 25:40.846
Let's not give up, Mu Jin.

389
25:41.686 --> 25:44.216
If you don't lose, you win.

390
25:45.616 --> 25:47.686
You will definitely win.

391
25:48.786 --> 25:51.026
Hang in there. You got this, Kim Mu Jin.

392
25:51.996 --> 25:52.996
Thank you.

393
25:54.366 --> 25:55.696
I am wide awake now.

394
26:10.246 --> 26:11.416
Hey, what happened to your eye?

395
26:12.016 --> 26:14.546
Who did this? Who the heck did this to you?

396
26:14.616 --> 26:15.846
Keep it down. The family will hear.

397
26:16.856 --> 26:19.756
Give me a name, right now. I will go destroy them all.

398
26:19.826 --> 26:21.186
Which school, what grade, what class?

399
26:23.156 --> 26:26.156
- Why do you assume I got beaten up? - You were...

400
26:27.496 --> 26:28.896
You got beaten up.

401
26:29.166 --> 26:30.436
You think I can't tell just by looking?

402
26:31.466 --> 26:32.766
Yes, I got hit.

403
26:33.466 --> 26:34.866
By a bat thrown by middle schoolers.

404
26:36.106 --> 26:37.106
What?

405
26:37.906 --> 26:39.076
Yesterday, on my way to bring rice cakes...

406
26:39.136 --> 26:40.646
to Grandmother Su Nam's,

407
26:41.276 --> 26:43.346
middle school kids lost a bat and it flew right into my eye,

408
26:43.416 --> 26:45.776
hitting me smack in the face. I fell backward,

409
26:46.176 --> 26:48.346
and got scraped up all over.

410
26:49.416 --> 26:50.416
Does that even make sense?

411
26:50.886 --> 26:52.256
Apparently, it does.

412
26:53.386 --> 26:54.826
Those middle school kids playing baseball...

413
26:54.986 --> 26:56.756
came over and even knelt down.

414
26:56.826 --> 26:59.196
I met their parents, and we went to the hospital.

415
27:00.466 --> 27:02.096
They said no broken bones, nothing serious.

416
27:02.596 --> 27:05.066
Just my eye is swollen like a panda.

417
27:05.136 --> 27:07.566
- Only bruised like this. - What hospital?

418
27:09.266 --> 27:11.076
You don't believe me?

419
27:12.436 --> 27:14.706
Is this all the trust you have in me?

420
27:16.976 --> 27:19.116
I actually bumped into Heung Sik at the hospital.

421
27:19.446 --> 27:21.486
If you don't believe me, call Heung Sik and ask him.

422
27:22.616 --> 27:24.286
What are you doing? Go on, call him.

423
27:25.486 --> 27:27.256
Why on earth would those middle school punks...

424
27:27.326 --> 27:29.656
let a bat fly into someone's face?

425
27:30.326 --> 27:32.096
Why play baseball if you are that bad?

426
27:32.696 --> 27:33.696
Tell me about it.

427
27:34.466 --> 27:36.096
I am thinking of going today or tomorrow...

428
27:36.166 --> 27:38.236
to shut their team down myself.

429
27:39.196 --> 27:41.836
What if it leaves a scar? What about school?

430
27:43.476 --> 27:44.476
I have to go.

431
27:45.476 --> 27:47.406
I skipped too much for modelling, so I must go.

432
27:48.676 --> 27:50.516
I'll go buy some bruise ointment and an eye patch.

433
27:55.246 --> 27:56.416
You scared me.

434
27:57.216 --> 27:58.816
The real shock is over there.

435
27:59.586 --> 28:01.226
Take a look at that jerk's face.

436
28:01.486 --> 28:02.486
What?

437
28:09.796 --> 28:11.336
Did you just get back from a war?

438
28:13.666 --> 28:15.236
The only thing you've got going for you...

439
28:15.306 --> 28:18.006
is your face, so what happened?

440
28:18.076 --> 28:20.306
- Who did this to you? - Stop it.

441
28:22.806 --> 28:24.046
Why are you covering my mouth?

442
28:24.376 --> 28:26.916
- Because I was afraid you'd scream. - Why?

443
28:26.986 --> 28:28.086
What is going on?

444
28:29.486 --> 28:31.716
I wasn't going to tell the family,

445
28:31.886 --> 28:33.526
and I wasn't going to tell you either.

446
28:34.786 --> 28:37.356
But since you're a woman, I thought you could help.

447
28:39.966 --> 28:41.526
Gyu Young left her husband's family.

448
28:42.196 --> 28:43.196
She ran away from home.

449
28:43.996 --> 28:45.796
Han Gyu Young did? Really?

450
28:52.676 --> 28:56.346
They say the world is full of delicious food

451
28:56.416 --> 29:00.386
But my taste buds belong to you alone

452
29:00.486 --> 29:04.186
My heart races at the sound of you bubbling

453
29:04.256 --> 29:08.226
And I give my soul to this fiery red broth!

454
29:09.226 --> 29:11.056
Instead of everyone fending for themselves today,

455
29:11.126 --> 29:13.326
I'll share some gimbap with you. Have some gimbap.

456
29:13.596 --> 29:15.266
I'm fine.

457
29:15.326 --> 29:17.996
Ramyeon is a hundred times better than gimbap to me.

458
29:18.796 --> 29:21.336
There's tuna in the gimbap, Grandpa.

459
29:21.936 --> 29:24.436
Tuna? No, I'm good.

460
29:24.506 --> 29:26.546
I can just put tuna in my ramyeon.

461
29:27.606 --> 29:30.976
I do not need anything on my memorial table

462
29:31.516 --> 29:34.586
Just put ramyeon there

463
29:34.886 --> 29:38.356
Only tuna ramyeon

464
29:43.496 --> 29:44.856
What was that sound?

465
29:45.396 --> 29:46.996
You said you wouldn't scream if I let go.

466
29:47.626 --> 29:48.996
How could I not scream?

467
29:49.566 --> 29:51.736
You got beaten to a pulp all because of Han Gyu Young.

468
29:52.466 --> 29:53.536
Should I have let them drag her away?

469
29:53.736 --> 29:56.206
Yes, you should have. Who are you to step in?

470
29:56.266 --> 29:58.076
Han Gyu Young doesn't even treat us like human beings.

471
29:58.336 --> 30:01.406
- Have you got no pride at all? - Stop saying things you don't mean.

472
30:01.906 --> 30:03.546
You would've jumped in too if you were there.

473
30:04.146 --> 30:05.146
No, I wouldn't.

474
30:05.876 --> 30:07.216
I never would have.

475
30:08.286 --> 30:09.986
- It's pink eye. - Gyu Rim is turning around.

476
30:09.986 --> 30:10.986
Come in.

477
30:16.086 --> 30:17.726
- What's wrong with Gyu Seo? - Pink eye.

478
30:17.796 --> 30:18.796
Pink eye.

479
30:19.926 --> 30:21.596
Pink eye? All of a sudden?

480
30:21.926 --> 30:23.696
What kind of pink eye? How did you catch it?

481
30:23.936 --> 30:26.706
Don't. They say you can catch it just by looking.

482
30:26.766 --> 30:28.606
Look at me. Aren't my eyes already red?

483
30:29.406 --> 30:31.676
Who catches pink eye just by looking?

484
30:31.976 --> 30:34.506
- Han Gyu Seo, come here. - No, no.

485
30:35.106 --> 30:38.876
My eyes are all crusty and gross. I don't want you to see it.

486
30:40.116 --> 30:41.116
Gyu Seo.

487
30:41.446 --> 30:44.416
Gyu Seo says he only wants you to see his handsome face.

488
30:44.586 --> 30:45.916
His face is all he has going for him,

489
30:45.986 --> 30:48.226
and his eyes are legendary.

490
30:48.286 --> 30:50.756
He really doesn't want you to see, so please don't look.

491
30:51.026 --> 30:52.756
- Right. - Yes.

492
30:53.296 --> 30:54.996
Then why did you scream?

493
30:57.536 --> 31:00.436
Because his eye was such a shock to look at.

494
31:01.266 --> 31:04.876
It's so gross and filthy, I can't even bear to look at it.

495
31:05.876 --> 31:07.176
I'm leaving before I catch it.

496
31:11.146 --> 31:12.946
Then let me take you to the eye clinic, Gyu Seo.

497
31:13.016 --> 31:14.986
Gyu Oh went to get an eyepatch and medicine.

498
31:15.746 --> 31:17.516
I have him, and I'm not a kid anymore.

499
31:18.156 --> 31:20.086
In the old days, I'd have had a son Gyeol's age.

500
31:21.886 --> 31:22.886
All right.

501
31:29.096 --> 31:30.596
Hey, what kind of eye infection is it...

502
31:30.596 --> 31:33.666
that's so terrible it makes you scream?

503
31:36.106 --> 31:37.406
Why did you have to have Gyu Young?

504
31:38.176 --> 31:39.176
What?

505
31:39.236 --> 31:41.206
You should have stopped at Gyu Rim and Gyu Oh.

506
31:41.276 --> 31:43.006
Why did you have Gyu Young?

507
31:45.276 --> 31:46.276
Hey, did I give birth to her?

508
31:47.286 --> 31:50.856
Why have someone like Gyu Young and make everyone worry pointlessly?

509
31:52.286 --> 31:54.726
What about Gyu Young? Did you see her?

510
31:55.756 --> 31:57.356
Did she give you a hard time again?

511
31:58.056 --> 32:00.996
I don't know. Anyway, karma is insanely real.

512
32:06.766 --> 32:08.136
What is she talking about?

513
32:09.536 --> 32:11.406
We were just talking about Gyu Seo's eye,

514
32:11.476 --> 32:13.246
so why bring up Gyu Young out of nowhere?

515
32:14.276 --> 32:17.616
Do you know how hard I'm trying to forget that name?

516
32:31.196 --> 32:35.926
You'll choke, Aunt Gyu Min. Drink some water while you eat.

517
32:37.596 --> 32:38.696
Here.

518
32:41.936 --> 32:42.936
Thanks.

519
32:46.846 --> 32:47.846
I'm sorry, Gyu Rim.

520
32:48.146 --> 32:49.776
After saying everyone should fend for themselves,

521
32:50.076 --> 32:53.516
I was just a bit stressed out.

522
32:55.846 --> 32:59.256
What does Gyu Seo's eye infection have to do with Gyu Young...

523
33:00.826 --> 33:02.986
Not that it could be related.

524
33:07.396 --> 33:09.366
What did you mean by karma being real?

525
33:09.936 --> 33:13.236
You reap the consequences of what you sow.

526
33:15.306 --> 33:16.836
Why did you say that all of a sudden?

527
33:17.536 --> 33:19.276
And bringing up Gyu Young out of the blue?

528
33:21.646 --> 33:23.076
No reason.

529
33:23.646 --> 33:24.876
I had a dream last night...

530
33:25.146 --> 33:27.286
that Gyu Young got an eye infection, but...

531
33:27.516 --> 33:30.216
right after that, Gyu Seo got one, and it just annoyed me so much.

532
33:32.116 --> 33:36.126
What time is it? I need to go to school.

533
33:36.186 --> 33:37.226
I'm heading out to school.

534
33:37.896 --> 33:39.996
- See you later. - See you later.

535
33:52.636 --> 33:54.046
Who are you calling?

536
33:54.706 --> 33:56.946
- Aunt Gyu Young. - The phone is turned off...

537
33:57.076 --> 33:59.046
so you will be connected to voicemail.

538
33:59.046 --> 34:00.886
Call charges will apply after the tone.

539
34:01.986 --> 34:03.216
Does it say her phone is turned off?

540
34:04.816 --> 34:06.986
She changed her number...

541
34:07.086 --> 34:08.156
to avoid taking our calls.

542
34:09.286 --> 34:10.296
Heartless girl.

543
34:12.356 --> 34:13.366
Gyu Young...

544
34:13.966 --> 34:15.596
She really is all right, isn't she?

545
34:18.296 --> 34:20.336
My mother brewed this jujube tea herself.

546
34:20.806 --> 34:22.366
They say it's a natural tranquillizer.

547
34:25.606 --> 34:26.746
Drink it whenever you remember.

548
34:31.246 --> 34:32.246
And...

549
34:32.416 --> 34:34.716
what are you going to do about Sung Wook?

550
34:35.446 --> 34:36.446
Shouldn't we lock him up...

551
34:36.516 --> 34:37.716
for assault and attempted kidnapping?

552
34:39.616 --> 34:40.786
Let me think about it.

553
34:42.386 --> 34:44.256
Should I go track him down and beat him up?

554
34:46.656 --> 34:47.926
Do you actually want to go to jail?

555
34:48.426 --> 34:49.596
If I have to, I will.

556
34:50.296 --> 34:52.536
Please, just stay out of it.

557
34:53.266 --> 34:55.006
I'd rather jump into the Han River.

558
35:00.306 --> 35:01.306
Did you...

559
35:02.146 --> 35:04.146
Did you call Gyu Seo?

560
35:05.876 --> 35:06.946
You tell him.

561
35:07.516 --> 35:09.386
Tell him he's dead if he tells the family.

562
35:09.746 --> 35:13.786
Not that. Thank him for saving you.

563
35:14.556 --> 35:17.056
You're always giving the twins a hard time,

564
35:17.326 --> 35:18.726
so tell him you're touched...

565
35:18.926 --> 35:20.396
he returned your malice with kindness.

566
35:23.226 --> 35:24.736
Did I ask him to save me?

567
35:26.066 --> 35:27.066
Seriously.

568
35:28.006 --> 35:29.106
Listen.

569
35:30.076 --> 35:34.646
Your heart runs on iced Americano, not warm blood, does it?

570
35:36.476 --> 35:37.676
Come on, eat up...

571
35:41.346 --> 35:43.716
Aren't men and women supposed to stay apart?

572
35:43.916 --> 35:46.556
What are you two doing with the door shut?

573
35:46.686 --> 35:49.326
Even if opposites attract,

574
35:50.426 --> 35:52.656
I'd never be interested in someone so rude.

575
35:53.356 --> 35:55.796
Even with a hundred truckloads of her, I wouldn't bat an eye.

576
35:57.266 --> 36:00.736
Even if she's out of her mind, she can still understand...

577
36:00.806 --> 36:02.606
when someone is talking bad about her.

578
36:04.136 --> 36:06.176
That little fox,

579
36:06.606 --> 36:09.576
she doesn't have an ounce of decency in her.

580
36:09.646 --> 36:11.276
Even with a thousand truckloads of her,

581
36:11.276 --> 36:12.416
it's a hard pass for me.

582
36:13.346 --> 36:14.386
Mom...

583
36:14.786 --> 36:16.956
If you tell me to marry a woman like that,

584
36:17.856 --> 36:19.556
I'll shave my head and become a monk.

585
36:19.616 --> 36:20.826
Just get out, go on.

586
36:22.826 --> 36:24.626
Gosh, that boy.

587
36:26.356 --> 36:29.366
Oh, he wasn't talking about you, dear.

588
36:29.596 --> 36:32.996
There's a girl like that three houses down...

589
36:33.066 --> 36:37.006
in the rice-cake alley. He was talking about her.

590
36:37.706 --> 36:40.106
They say mackerel is good for the brain,

591
36:40.376 --> 36:43.546
so I braised it with radish and aged kimchi.

592
36:43.616 --> 36:46.886
Come on, let's go eat some delicious food, okay?

593
36:49.446 --> 36:50.786
Are you upset?

594
36:53.156 --> 36:57.296
If you eat your meal nicely, later on, Grandma will...

595
36:57.656 --> 37:01.866
buy you an ice cream, and some fried chicken, too.

596
37:02.166 --> 37:05.136
What should I do with you? Oh, dear. What should I do?

597
37:06.366 --> 37:07.536
Oh my.

598
37:08.966 --> 37:12.736
You ought to eat while it's warm. Well, nothing can be done.

599
37:13.576 --> 37:15.546
All right, eat whenever you feel like it,

600
37:15.606 --> 37:16.606
okay?

601
37:18.646 --> 37:19.646
Come on out.

602
37:23.486 --> 37:25.016
You made Gyu Young pout.

603
37:26.056 --> 37:28.156
Heung Sik, you know how hard she has it.

604
37:28.226 --> 37:29.586
Did you really have to corner...

605
37:29.656 --> 37:32.026
that poor girl and say such harsh things?

606
37:45.876 --> 37:47.676
(Go out of business!)

607
37:47.746 --> 37:49.546
(Get lost, Kim Mu Jin!)

608
37:49.606 --> 37:51.416
(Enjoy it yourself!)

609
37:51.476 --> 37:52.476
(Exposing the unscrupulous owner Kim Mu Jin)

610
37:52.546 --> 37:54.186
(Stop reusing leftover food now!)

611
37:54.246 --> 37:55.986
(Shut down and rest at home! Get out!)

612
37:56.046 --> 37:58.216
(Get lost, Kim Mu Jin!)

613
38:06.326 --> 38:07.726
(Today's special: Kim Mu Jin's food made from recycled food waste)

614
38:11.366 --> 38:12.366
What...

615
38:14.836 --> 38:15.836
What is all this?

616
38:22.446 --> 38:23.446
Leave it as it is.

617
38:24.116 --> 38:25.516
We need to preserve the scene.

618
38:29.646 --> 38:31.386
The security camera will show everything,

619
38:31.456 --> 38:32.856
so let us report it to the police first.

620
38:33.386 --> 38:35.726
Mu Jin. Hey.

621
38:53.376 --> 38:54.376
Are you hungry?

622
38:55.076 --> 38:56.076
Want me to make some pasta?

623
38:58.476 --> 39:00.486
Did you go meditate on a mountain or something?

624
39:04.616 --> 39:05.616
Should I fight back?

625
39:06.356 --> 39:07.356
How...

626
39:08.426 --> 39:09.456
How should I fight?

627
39:11.696 --> 39:12.696
Though...

628
39:13.626 --> 39:15.626
If I fight, I fight all the way to the end.

629
39:17.766 --> 39:19.836
Even if they cry and whine, begging me for mercy...

630
39:20.466 --> 39:21.636
I will never let them off the hook.

631
39:22.936 --> 39:25.536
I never just let things fizzle out and quit halfway through.

632
39:26.636 --> 39:28.046
I will not let go until they drop dead.

633
39:28.446 --> 39:30.006
Right, that is right. A Jindo dog.

634
39:30.946 --> 39:33.046
You always had that Jindo tenacity, didn't you?

635
39:34.446 --> 39:36.616
You are usually the gentlest soul in the world,

636
39:36.886 --> 39:38.816
but once you snap, nobody can handle you.

637
39:38.886 --> 39:40.156
That is our Kim Mu Jin.

638
39:41.686 --> 39:44.456
Whoever gets bitten by you is as good as dead.

639
39:47.126 --> 39:49.396
I am hungry. I will go whip up some pasta.

640
39:49.566 --> 39:50.636
Let us eat and then get to work.

641
40:01.076 --> 40:03.546
All existing reservations were completely cancelled,

642
40:04.316 --> 40:05.876
and it looks like no one will be making any bookings...

643
40:05.946 --> 40:07.346
anytime soon.

644
40:07.916 --> 40:10.356
No walk-in guests either, for a while.

645
40:12.586 --> 40:14.086
Even the applicants who passed the final interview...

646
40:14.256 --> 40:15.326
all said they will not be joining us.

647
40:15.756 --> 40:17.826
They did not even bother to call.

648
40:18.726 --> 40:21.096
They all sent rejection messages.

649
40:24.336 --> 40:25.636
Darn it.

650
40:26.366 --> 40:28.136
Without a dramatic turnaround,

651
40:28.906 --> 40:30.506
how much longer can we hold out?

652
40:32.906 --> 40:34.946
Factoring in rent, loan interest, ingredients,

653
40:35.006 --> 40:36.446
and everything else,

654
40:38.776 --> 40:41.416
at least 48 days, at most 63 days?

655
40:45.686 --> 40:47.086
I was reading comments this morning,

656
40:47.656 --> 40:49.086
and someone claimed they found maggots...

657
40:49.586 --> 40:53.656
in our restaurant's food. I couldn't just let that slide,

658
40:53.766 --> 40:55.926
so I got hacker buddies to track it down.

659
40:56.066 --> 40:57.296
And do you know who it was?

660
40:58.196 --> 40:59.466
A second-grade elementary schooler.

661
40:59.736 --> 41:02.306
And the kid has never even set foot in our restaurant.

662
41:05.036 --> 41:07.146
The world is full of attention seekers.

663
41:07.946 --> 41:09.276
In this messed-up world,

664
41:09.346 --> 41:11.346
people are just filled with rage and stress.

665
41:11.546 --> 41:14.246
"You picked the wrong day, you are going down."

666
41:15.016 --> 41:17.086
The moment they find a target, they get ecstatic...

667
41:17.156 --> 41:18.886
and carpet-bomb them like crazy right now.

668
41:21.186 --> 41:22.786
If we fight back against each and every one,

669
41:22.926 --> 41:24.096
sure, we can win.

670
41:24.226 --> 41:26.426
I mean, we are a hundred percent innocent,

671
41:26.496 --> 41:30.436
so legally, we would definitely win. But what good is winning lawsuits...

672
41:30.496 --> 41:33.566
if it takes years? By then, people will be like,

673
41:33.636 --> 41:35.366
"Was there ever a restaurant like that?"

674
41:36.166 --> 41:37.436
No one will even care.

675
41:43.776 --> 41:46.616
You said we have 48 days, right? At most, 63 days.

676
41:46.946 --> 41:48.446
Plus, if I chip in some of my own money,

677
41:48.846 --> 41:49.986
we can hold out a bit longer than that.

678
41:50.046 --> 41:53.656
Are you not listening to me? Game over already.

679
41:53.786 --> 41:55.286
Before you end up penniless...

680
41:57.396 --> 41:59.896
and get beat down any worse, let us just fold.

681
42:00.896 --> 42:02.566
- No. - Kim Mu Jin.

682
42:02.666 --> 42:04.036
You said we have 63 days.

683
42:04.796 --> 42:06.336
How do you know whether I can do it or not?

684
42:07.136 --> 42:09.536
I will not lose. Not over my dead body.

685
42:10.506 --> 42:11.876
They say if you do not lose, you win.

686
42:13.206 --> 42:14.406
Gyu Rim said so too.

687
42:15.006 --> 42:16.346
She said I would win in the end.

688
42:27.856 --> 42:29.426
(Get lost!)

689
42:31.596 --> 42:33.296
(Go out of business!)

690
42:44.936 --> 42:46.076
Darn it.

691
42:46.136 --> 42:47.506
(Eat it all yourself!)

692
42:47.606 --> 42:49.046
When I was young and foolish,

693
42:49.776 --> 42:51.546
I drew graffiti on someone's wall.

694
42:52.216 --> 42:53.676
I really regret it now.

695
42:55.746 --> 42:58.086
If it is still there, I want to go find them...

696
42:58.386 --> 43:01.526
- and apologize. - Go for it.

697
43:01.786 --> 43:03.156
I will go with you.

698
43:05.626 --> 43:07.266
I will clean everything today,

699
43:07.796 --> 43:09.366
and I will open for dinner tomorrow.

700
43:09.966 --> 43:11.096
Even without any reservations.

701
43:12.436 --> 43:14.266
I am sure some walk-ins will show up.

702
43:14.936 --> 43:16.336
If not, so be it.

703
43:18.936 --> 43:20.236
I will open up the kitchen,

704
43:21.206 --> 43:22.606
and I will open up the fridge too.

705
43:23.876 --> 43:25.076
"If you want to see..."

706
43:25.876 --> 43:27.246
"how your food is cooked,"

707
43:27.816 --> 43:29.616
"come and see for yourself."

708
43:30.446 --> 43:32.486
Sounds aggressive.

709
43:33.316 --> 43:34.556
Some might look at this...

710
43:34.626 --> 43:36.786
and think it is just smoke and mirrors,

711
43:38.196 --> 43:40.966
but sincerity will get through. Why will this not come off?

712
43:42.626 --> 43:44.166
Just like how my sincerity got through to you.

713
43:49.966 --> 43:52.106
I have been thinking about something too.

714
43:54.706 --> 43:55.806
Want to hear it?

715
43:58.046 --> 43:59.046
What is it?

716
44:00.116 --> 44:01.246
(Chairman Hong Ok Seon)

717
44:19.836 --> 44:23.866
Hey, do you think...

718
44:24.406 --> 44:26.276
I do not know about parasites like you?

719
44:26.706 --> 44:28.376
Could you please just get lost? Please.

720
44:28.376 --> 44:30.646
Are you perhaps...

721
44:30.916 --> 44:34.016
trying to become Cinderella just like your mother?

722
44:35.146 --> 44:39.256
Wake up from that dream, girl. You are a leech. A cockroach.

723
44:43.586 --> 44:46.096
I feel like I cursed at her.

724
44:48.826 --> 44:51.436
Even if I did, I should have done it with some class.

725
44:51.496 --> 44:52.996
If I threw vulgar insults around,

726
44:53.796 --> 44:55.966
she will question my character.

727
44:57.376 --> 45:00.976
Good grief. It is not like I can call and ask.

728
45:12.856 --> 45:13.886
Yes.

729
45:14.386 --> 45:15.456
How is your stomach feeling?

730
45:16.256 --> 45:18.656
You emptied a bottle and a half of soju yesterday.

731
45:20.396 --> 45:23.466
On top of that, I drank a bottle of liquor.

732
45:25.366 --> 45:27.436
You really mixed it up.

733
45:29.236 --> 45:31.176
Mixing drinks is bad for you.

734
45:31.836 --> 45:33.176
Should I pick up some medicine for you?

735
45:33.776 --> 45:36.106
No. I am fine. I took some already.

736
45:37.546 --> 45:40.516
Hey, take a rockfish from your sushi restaurant's tank...

737
45:40.716 --> 45:44.456
and make a clear soup with it. Put in lots of bean sprouts.

738
45:45.556 --> 45:47.486
Bean sprouts are the best for hangovers.

739
45:47.756 --> 45:49.686
Speaking of bean sprouts,

740
45:50.186 --> 45:52.126
it reminds me of that person.

741
45:53.426 --> 45:54.566
"Bean sprouts."

742
45:55.666 --> 45:57.536
"Did you toss the bean sprouts?"

743
45:58.496 --> 46:00.166
"With soy sauce and sesame oil,"

744
46:01.066 --> 46:02.636
"did you toss them thoroughly?"

745
46:06.976 --> 46:08.646
You always make me laugh.

746
46:09.006 --> 46:10.916
Hey, you are probably the only one...

747
46:11.276 --> 46:13.816
in the entire world who laughs at my dad jokes.

748
46:13.976 --> 46:16.646
That is why you and I are such dear friends...

749
46:16.746 --> 46:17.856
(Suragan Side Dishes)

750
46:17.916 --> 46:19.286
Whoa, what the heck?

751
46:19.656 --> 46:21.826
Hey, what is wrong? What happened?

752
46:22.456 --> 46:23.456
Nothing.

753
46:25.996 --> 46:27.096
Welcome.

754
46:27.626 --> 46:30.836
A customer just came in, so I will call you later.

755
46:30.936 --> 46:33.536
Take care of yourself. Yes.

756
46:34.566 --> 46:35.566
Excuse me...

757
46:36.366 --> 46:37.366
Welcome.

758
46:37.436 --> 46:39.976
It looks like the owner stepped out for a moment.

759
46:41.646 --> 46:44.846
I work here.

760
46:44.916 --> 46:47.486
I just went to the restroom for a bit.

761
46:49.286 --> 46:51.586
You must be the new helper.

762
46:53.486 --> 46:55.556
I am the owner's father.

763
47:02.426 --> 47:04.966
I look pretty young, don't I?

764
47:06.836 --> 47:07.866
Some people...

765
47:08.366 --> 47:10.976
even mistake me for Gyu Rim's older brother.

766
47:17.106 --> 47:18.116
By the way,

767
47:18.646 --> 47:21.316
you look awfully familiar.

768
47:22.816 --> 47:25.256
Have we met somewhere before, by any chance?

769
47:26.316 --> 47:28.786
No, this is my first time seeing you.

770
47:30.956 --> 47:32.296
That cannot be.

771
47:35.366 --> 47:38.896
I have definitely seen your face somewhere.

772
47:40.466 --> 47:43.436
It is just because I have a friendly face.

773
47:45.136 --> 47:46.506
No.

774
47:47.206 --> 47:49.276
It is not that friendly of a face.

775
47:50.006 --> 47:53.116
I am considered pretty, you know.

776
47:54.816 --> 47:56.816
Well, sure,

777
47:57.786 --> 48:00.956
I never said you were ugly. If I had to say, though,

778
48:01.726 --> 48:02.956
you are not really my type.

779
48:09.596 --> 48:10.696
Anyway,

780
48:12.166 --> 48:14.066
here is my...

781
48:14.936 --> 48:16.236
When my daughter gets back,

782
48:16.336 --> 48:18.736
please tell her that her dad bought pastries...

783
48:18.806 --> 48:21.046
and to eat them when she gets hungry.

784
48:22.246 --> 48:23.576
You have some too.

785
48:51.876 --> 48:54.246
Even if I had plastic surgery...

786
48:54.906 --> 48:56.946
and came back with a mole on my face,

787
48:57.506 --> 49:00.316
how could you not recognise a woman...

788
49:00.376 --> 49:01.816
you slept with, lived with, and had children with?

789
49:11.856 --> 49:12.896
Han Seok Joong.

790
49:14.866 --> 49:15.896
How is it that...

791
49:16.526 --> 49:18.736
you are still so handsome even after getting older?

792
49:19.396 --> 49:20.796
It only breaks my heart more.

793
49:25.376 --> 49:26.806
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

794
49:26.876 --> 49:28.706
Today, we will have you prepare for the opening yourself.

795
49:28.776 --> 49:30.746
- Okay. - You said you do not have...

796
49:30.806 --> 49:32.176
any store management experience, right?

797
49:32.246 --> 49:33.246
Yes, that is right.

798
49:33.446 --> 49:36.146
Still, since you are teaching me so systematically,

799
49:36.386 --> 49:38.086
I feel a lot more confident.

800
49:38.156 --> 49:40.886
Great. First, when a customer walks in,

801
49:40.956 --> 49:43.026
would you try guiding them through the kiosk?

802
49:43.556 --> 49:44.856
Just take your time and give it a try.

803
49:45.456 --> 49:47.496
(Franchise Training in Progress)

804
49:47.556 --> 49:51.436
Welcome. If you just tap the kiosk like this,

805
49:51.536 --> 49:53.336
you can place your order.

806
49:54.466 --> 49:57.436
You get more perks the more you order here,

807
49:57.506 --> 50:00.006
- so please keep that in mind. - You did great.

808
50:00.336 --> 50:02.346
Now, let us try inspecting the ingredients.

809
50:02.706 --> 50:03.876
Right this way.

810
50:13.516 --> 50:14.526
This date right here...

811
50:14.626 --> 50:16.026
is what we go by for using things today.

812
50:18.296 --> 50:20.696
Check the fridge temperature twice a day.

813
50:20.696 --> 50:22.166
All right, got it.

814
50:22.226 --> 50:24.026
Okay, I will check on the other ingredients.

815
50:24.096 --> 50:25.096
Okay.

816
50:25.866 --> 50:27.396
Check temperature.

817
50:27.466 --> 50:29.036
(Franchise Training in Progress)

818
50:32.876 --> 50:34.706
You look like a real boss.

819
50:35.306 --> 50:36.506
You can do it, Go Yoon Hee!

820
50:37.246 --> 50:38.346
Count me in as a regular.

821
50:38.416 --> 50:40.346
I am going to eat here every day now.

822
50:47.756 --> 50:48.826
Wait a second.

823
51:09.376 --> 51:12.876
Hello, Chairman. What brings you here?

824
51:13.646 --> 51:14.716
Congratulations.

825
51:15.346 --> 51:17.546
Thank you, you really did not have to.

826
51:17.616 --> 51:18.616
How are things going?

827
51:18.686 --> 51:21.186
- Good, we are working hard. - Good.

828
51:24.396 --> 51:25.396
Hello.

829
51:35.266 --> 51:36.306
Surprised?

830
51:37.636 --> 51:39.306
Out of all our locations nationwide,

831
51:39.376 --> 51:41.506
you are the youngest franchise owners,

832
51:41.946 --> 51:43.106
so I wanted to show my gratitude...

833
51:43.446 --> 51:45.746
and see how you were doing, which is why I stopped by.

834
51:46.276 --> 51:47.276
Thank you.

835
51:48.016 --> 51:50.246
- Excuse me, we have a customer. - Go ahead.

836
51:50.316 --> 51:52.386
Take your time chatting. Welcome.

837
51:55.756 --> 51:58.556
I suggested we grab a meal together, so why did you not reach out?

838
51:58.826 --> 52:00.196
Did you think I was just being polite?

839
52:01.196 --> 52:03.826
You keep asking someone like me to have a meal,

840
52:03.926 --> 52:05.366
and I just do not really understand why.

841
52:07.436 --> 52:08.436
Is that so?

842
52:09.836 --> 52:13.106
Still, do you not think it is good to know someone like me?

843
52:14.406 --> 52:15.876
Running a business,

844
52:16.146 --> 52:18.016
I see plenty of people flocking around me,

845
52:18.076 --> 52:21.286
hoping to catch a crumb... or get some handout.

846
52:22.146 --> 52:23.716
I'm not interested in crumbs.

847
52:24.616 --> 52:27.156
I'm not the type to go after scraps.

848
52:33.456 --> 52:35.226
Genetics are truly something else,

849
52:35.826 --> 52:38.266
aren't they? Once you dislike something,

850
52:38.336 --> 52:40.466
even all the treasure in the world won't change your mind, right?

851
52:40.536 --> 52:44.066
Hating to burden others, refusing to be indebted,

852
52:44.506 --> 52:45.706
incapable of flattery.

853
52:47.506 --> 52:48.846
I'm talking about your mother.

854
52:50.046 --> 52:52.176
You are the spitting image of her, Gyu Oh.

855
52:55.216 --> 52:56.886
What do you mean by that?

856
52:59.356 --> 53:01.686
Forgive my belated introduction.

857
53:02.056 --> 53:05.226
I am the man living with your mother.

858
53:11.796 --> 53:13.766
Your mother was just like this.

859
53:14.536 --> 53:16.436
When I first proposed to her,

860
53:17.506 --> 53:19.706
she gave me no opening at all.

861
53:20.636 --> 53:21.746
So I wondered,

862
53:21.806 --> 53:23.676
"Is it because I'm a widower with a child?"

863
53:23.906 --> 53:25.876
After all, in this industry,

864
53:25.946 --> 53:27.776
I'm considered quite a successful businessman.

865
53:29.546 --> 53:31.416
Anyway, I pursued her for a year and a half.

866
53:31.716 --> 53:33.356
With all the bouquets I showered on her...

867
53:33.416 --> 53:34.416
over that year and a half,

868
53:34.486 --> 53:36.126
I could have opened several flower shops.

869
53:37.226 --> 53:38.626
You're just like her, Gyu Oh.

870
53:52.506 --> 53:55.046
I'm truly relieved to hear that my mother has met...

871
53:55.776 --> 53:56.876
such a wonderful person.

872
53:58.946 --> 54:00.646
How do you know I'm a good person?

873
54:01.386 --> 54:03.586
That you are warm and honourable, Chairman Jang,

874
54:04.686 --> 54:07.616
is something everyone at this company already knows.

875
54:10.056 --> 54:11.086
Thank you.

876
54:13.026 --> 54:14.056
Get up.

877
54:14.626 --> 54:15.626
Come on, stand up.

878
54:21.906 --> 54:22.906
All right then.

879
54:25.236 --> 54:26.636
Let's share a meal sometime soon.

880
54:30.446 --> 54:31.476
Yes, sir.

881
54:34.046 --> 54:35.116
Well...

882
54:35.216 --> 54:37.586
How is your sister Han Gyu Young doing?

883
54:39.886 --> 54:41.786
We don't really keep in touch.

884
54:43.756 --> 54:44.796
Is that so?

885
54:47.056 --> 54:48.596
Why do you suddenly ask about my sister?

886
54:50.066 --> 54:51.126
Oh, no special reason.

887
54:51.736 --> 54:54.336
I thought Gyu Rim and Gyu Young...

888
54:54.396 --> 54:56.736
could all join me for a meal.

889
54:56.736 --> 54:58.476
All right, then.

890
54:59.506 --> 55:00.536
I'll see you again.

891
55:07.876 --> 55:09.086
This feels nice.

892
55:15.826 --> 55:18.096
Do I come by too often?

893
55:19.026 --> 55:20.026
Yes.

894
55:21.266 --> 55:22.266
My goodness.

895
55:22.366 --> 55:24.096
What do you mean, too often?

896
55:24.226 --> 55:26.536
You came this morning, and you came at lunchtime.

897
55:27.136 --> 55:29.636
- Were you counting my visits? - No, I didn't count.

898
55:29.706 --> 55:31.476
I simply remembered.

899
55:34.876 --> 55:35.876
Hey.

900
55:38.776 --> 55:40.716
Is this a hotel?

901
55:41.646 --> 55:43.416
Aren't you going to run your shop, ma'am?

902
55:44.616 --> 55:48.026
Why do you all care so much about how I run my business?

903
55:48.426 --> 55:51.126
I can see customers coming in from right here,

904
55:51.186 --> 55:53.096
so you don't need to worry.

905
55:57.566 --> 56:01.736
Oh my, you are certainly living the life of luxury.

906
56:02.236 --> 56:06.076
You spend more time lying down here than you do at your side dish shop.

907
56:06.136 --> 56:09.946
Seriously. I cannot even lie down in peace.

908
56:11.446 --> 56:14.786
Are you picking on a customer right now?

909
56:14.786 --> 56:17.746
- I am not picking on you. - We are not picking on you.

910
56:17.816 --> 56:19.016
No one is picking on you.

911
56:20.386 --> 56:22.026
Just one of you speak at a time.

912
56:22.086 --> 56:24.386
Who asked for a three-piece dialect combo?

913
56:26.296 --> 56:27.926
Never mind, Mom.

914
56:28.596 --> 56:31.296
What happened to that puppy we adopted a few days ago?

915
56:31.566 --> 56:32.766
Did you leave it alone?

916
56:33.536 --> 56:34.966
You adopted a puppy?

917
56:35.506 --> 56:39.376
Yes. It looks just like a little fox.

918
56:40.706 --> 56:43.546
A guest is over right now playing with it,

919
56:43.606 --> 56:47.346
- so do not worry too much, okay? - A guest? What guest?

920
57:07.466 --> 57:10.106
I am completely fine. I have my reasons for playing dumb...

921
57:10.736 --> 57:11.736
I mean,

922
57:13.006 --> 57:14.776
I am just pretending to have amnesia,

923
57:15.106 --> 57:16.206
so please just leave.

924
57:24.046 --> 57:25.716
Is fraud your specialty?

925
57:26.486 --> 57:29.526
Faking amnesia and even scamming an old lady.

926
57:32.726 --> 57:34.696
Don't you dare tell Grandmother Su Nam.

927
57:34.896 --> 57:36.126
I will make you regret it.

928
57:36.466 --> 57:37.866
And what are you going to do if you do not?

929
57:38.866 --> 57:39.866
Hey.

930
57:40.266 --> 57:41.266
What?

931
57:42.166 --> 57:44.066
I told you to leave.

932
57:44.136 --> 57:45.236
I'll pay double your fee,

933
57:45.306 --> 57:47.106
so just get out, you quack.

934
57:47.576 --> 57:51.076
Who do you think you are? You are just a criminal.

935
57:52.046 --> 57:53.116
A criminal?

936
57:54.176 --> 57:57.446
Who is a criminal? Did you see me commit a crime?

937
57:58.216 --> 57:59.816
I did not see it, but I heard about it.

938
58:00.286 --> 58:01.726
If you want to pull a scam, do it alone.

939
58:01.786 --> 58:03.286
Why drag my dad into this?

940
58:03.526 --> 58:05.896
Do you know what mess my dad is in because of you?

941
58:08.426 --> 58:09.466
Who are you?

942
58:11.736 --> 58:15.606
I am Jang Hoon Tae's biological daughter.

943
58:15.736 --> 58:16.736
Got a problem with that?

944
58:25.946 --> 58:29.416
We could change it every day and offer one special dish.

945
58:33.486 --> 58:35.856
Dishes that were never on the menu before.

946
58:50.806 --> 58:53.876
Dishes you can only taste if you come to this restaurant.

947
59:03.386 --> 59:04.546
Here you go.

948
59:23.606 --> 59:26.736
The one-of-a-kind dishes...

949
59:27.036 --> 59:29.146
you used to make just for me, Mu Jin.

950
59:40.656 --> 59:42.926
What do you think? Let me taste it too.

951
59:43.686 --> 59:44.956
Just a second.

952
59:46.926 --> 59:48.096
Pretty good.

953
01:00:41.646 --> 01:00:42.816
Taste it...

954
01:00:43.916 --> 01:00:46.016
and tell me if it is still the flavour you loved.

955
01:00:47.116 --> 01:00:48.686
Give me an honest critique.

956
01:01:41.136 --> 01:01:42.506
And for that special dish,

957
01:01:42.576 --> 01:01:44.546
the customer gets to decide the price.

958
01:01:45.076 --> 01:01:48.016
If they do not like it, they do not have to pay.

959
01:02:00.696 --> 01:02:03.126
That was delicious, Chef Kim.

960
01:02:05.196 --> 01:02:07.396
It was the best meal of my life.

961
01:02:28.116 --> 01:02:29.826
(Han Gyu Rim)

962
01:02:38.266 --> 01:02:39.466
Hello.

963
01:02:40.096 --> 01:02:41.596
This is Han Gyu Rim.

964
01:02:42.606 --> 01:02:44.606
I was so flustered yesterday...

965
01:02:45.376 --> 01:02:46.936
that I could not give you an answer.

966
01:02:49.706 --> 01:02:50.806
That answer...

967
01:02:52.716 --> 01:02:54.176
I will give it to you now.

968
01:03:07.656 --> 01:03:08.966
I have a son...

969
01:03:09.726 --> 01:03:11.226
named Gyeol.

970
01:03:13.396 --> 01:03:14.696
I love Mu Jin...

971
01:03:15.566 --> 01:03:17.136
as much as I love Gyeol.

972
01:03:19.136 --> 01:03:20.836
If Gyeol faces a difficult path,

973
01:03:21.846 --> 01:03:23.676
I will stand in front to lead him.

974
01:03:25.216 --> 01:03:26.616
And if Gyeol is happy,

975
01:03:27.376 --> 01:03:30.316
I will stand behind to support him.

976
01:03:35.286 --> 01:03:36.586
That is how...

977
01:03:39.026 --> 01:03:40.556
I love Mu Jin.

978
01:03:44.796 --> 01:03:46.336
Never again...

979
01:03:47.266 --> 01:03:51.366
will I be the one to let go of Mu Jin's hand.

980
01:03:54.876 --> 01:03:56.106
I am sorry.

981
01:04:54.936 --> 01:04:56.736
(Love on the Menu)

982
01:04:56.906 --> 01:04:59.276
My mom really wants to see Han Gyu Oh.

983
01:04:59.276 --> 01:05:00.936
Where is Han Gyu Oh?

984
01:05:01.006 --> 01:05:03.276
Please save me. You said I was your daughter, too.

985
01:05:03.376 --> 01:05:05.816
- Then act like a father. - If you keep doing someone favours,

986
01:05:05.876 --> 01:05:07.816
- they mistake it for entitlement. - Why are you crying,

987
01:05:07.916 --> 01:05:08.946
breaking your father's heart?

988
01:05:09.016 --> 01:05:10.946
Who are you? Who do you think you are?

989
01:05:11.016 --> 01:05:12.616
Why are you making me feel miserable, too?

990
01:05:12.686 --> 01:05:15.156
There are no customers. Not a single one.

991
01:05:15.226 --> 01:05:18.356
Promise me that you won't be the first to let go of my hand.

992
01:05:18.356 --> 01:05:21.656
I want Mu Jin to be ruined.
